OTel Incident Sandbox

This repository retains unchanged source from OpenTelemetry Go contrib,
commit 33d034d81ab04b64c460717c5f42080324ca281f, under upstream/.
The full 46-file otelhttp module and the complete 12,892-byte upstream LICENSE
are retained. The LICENSE contains Apache-2.0 text and a Go Authors BSD notice.
Original copyright, SPDX and other source notices remain unchanged.

The active example/client/client.go and example/server/server.go are modified
OpenTelemetry examples. Modifications add synthetic support-request cases,
TraceContext-only propagation, header evidence and bounded loopback/process
lifecycle. Their original Apache copyright/SPDX headers and prominent
modification notices remain. The example module replacement path is modified
to load the retained local source; dependency versions/checksums are preserved.

Task-authored portability/verification glue, documentation and evidence
packaging are distributed under the root MIT LICENSE. That license applies
only to those authored additions and does not relicense upstream source or
the modified Go example derivatives. Applicable upstream license text is
available in upstream/LICENSE. Source identities and derivations are recorded
in source-manifest.json and verification/derivation.json.
